🔹 Topic: Amazon EventBridge — Powering Event-Driven Automation in AWS
In modern cloud-native architectures, event-driven automation is key for scalability and decoupling services.
 That’s exactly where Amazon EventBridge (formerly CloudWatch Events) shines — helping DevOps and SREs build real-time, event-based workflows across AWS and SaaS applications.

